NOTICE — Third-party dependencies
=================================

The application and its finance component library (src/finance/) are original
source authored for this template and licensed under this repository's LICENSE
(MIT). There is no external or private package to install — the library ships as
first-class source and is imported via the @/finance alias.

Third-party dependencies
------------------------
The app builds on standard open-source packages, each under its own license as
declared in package.json — including React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, lucide-react, and
pptxgenjs. The opt-in official Fabric engine (enabled per-visual with
engine="fabric" / gridEngine="fabric") additionally uses Vega / Vega-Lite and the
@microsoft/fabric-datagrid, @microsoft/fabric-visuals and
@microsoft/fabric-visuals-core packages. Those Fabric packages power the opt-in
engine only; every visual and grid also ships a built-in, dependency-free engine,
so the app runs without them.
